# Vulnerable PraisonAI MCP server, CVE-2026-47394 (arbitrary file read via
# praisonai.workflow.show / workflow.validate / deploy.validate). Real pinned install from
# PyPI, no reimplementation and no stub: the handlers in
# praisonai/mcp_server/adapters/cli_tools.py open the caller-supplied path with no containment.
# Base pinned by digest for cross-machine reproducibility (python:3.12-slim-bookworm).
